Error [E0209]: Implicit clone of `t`
  --> unmarked_take_keeps_mark_for_cleanup_generic_and_capture_3.jet:6:30
    |
  6 |     f :: () -> print(consume(t))
    |                              ^
 Why: `consume` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^t`) if this is the last use, or copy first with `t.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209
